give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Late Night Drive By\"", "italic": true, "color": "aqua"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Snake Charmer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose an alive player: a chosen Demon swaps characters & alignments with you & is then poisoned."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lycanthrope", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose an alive player. If good, they die & the Demon doesn\u2019t kill tonight. One good player registers as evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Slayer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fool", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nThe 1st time you die, you don't."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Alchemist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou have a Minion ability. When using this, the Storyteller may prompt you to choose differently."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Minstrel", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen a Minion dies by execution, all other players (except Travellers) are drunk until dusk tomorrow."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Tinker", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou might die at any time."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Recluse", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou might register as evil & as a Minion or Demon, even if dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Golem", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou may only nominate once per game. When you do, if the nominee is not the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Godfather", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nYou start knowing which Outsiders are in play. If 1 died today, choose a player tonight: they die. [-1 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Psychopath", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach day, before nominations, you may publicly choose a player: they die. If executed, you only die if you lose roshambo."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Scarlet Woman", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf there are 5 or more players alive & the Demon dies, you become the Demon. (Travellers don't count.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pukka", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a player: they are poisoned. The previously poisoned player dies then becomes healthy."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Imp", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. If you kill yourself this way, a Minion becomes the Imp."]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Late Night Drive By Script", "italic": false, "color": "aqua", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Late Night Drive By\"", "italic": false, "color": "aqua"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]